      "url": "https://www.redlands.edu/strategicplan",
      "summary": "The University of Redlands' strategic plan, titled 'Forward Together', aims to provide a student-focused and personalized education by 2032, positioning itself as a leader in California. The plan focuses on three main themes: launching student success, enhancing a sustainable educational environment, and fostering future-focused innovation. With key priorities including diversity, financial sustainability, and technological enhancement, the university seeks to deliver on its mission of nurturing a diverse community for meaningful and impactful lives.",
